factcheck by anthropic/claude-haiku-5-5: 4 problems
  The article says the garbage has been dumped for many years in the quarry, and the draft's reel_script/caption gap aside, the caption claims 'ஆகஸ்ட் மாதம் முதல்' without the year; the article says 'கடந்த ஆக.' so month is correct, but the caption's claim that the groundwater is contaminated ('நிலத்தடி நீரும் மாசடைந்துள்ளதாக') is in the article, so no issue there.
  The caption's date line '🗓️ நாள்: 23 நவம்பர்' invents a specific month (November) for the 23rd; the article only says '23ம் தேதி' with no month named.
  The reel_script and slides say 'நாளொன்றுக்கு 50க்கும் மேற்பட்ட லாரிகளில்' while the article says 50-க்கும் மேற்பட்ட முறை குப்பை லாரிகளில் — 'lorries' count vs 'trips' is a slight mismatch in meaning, mostly acceptable but the slide's '50க்கும் மேற்பட்ட குப்பை லாரிகள் வருகின்றன' implies 50 distinct trucks rather than 50 trips.
  The reel_script omits the key fact that the dumping was originally permitted for only three months and the people's ultimatum relates to the Monday handover; the reel does mention the three months but the important fact that Tiruppur corporation garbage is being dumped is included, so the main missing point is the Tiruppur corporation's garbage is not clearly tied to the complaint of burning garbage by miscreants (விஷமிகள் தீ வைக்கின்றனர்) which is a significant cause of the smoke and is absent from the reel_script.
